   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AWID 2013-2017 - AWID</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">AWID 2013-2017</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">K&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;det &#xe4;r avsett f&#xf6;r impl.av AWIDS stategiska plan 2013-2017.     M&#xe5;let &#xe4;r bl a att skapa en stark global kvinnor&#xe4;ttsr&#xf6;relse samt       p&#xe5;verka givare och andra akt&#xf6;rer att st&#xe4;rka sitt st&#xf6;d f&#xf6;r kvinnors    r&#xe4;ttigheter. AWID  fokusomr &#xe4;r: 1) att utmana religi&#xf6;s                fundamentalism; 2) st&#xe4;rka ekonomisk r&#xe4;ttvisa &amp; fin.f&#xf6;r kvinn r&#xe4;ttigh  3)r&#xe4;tten att kunna f&#xf6;rsvara sina r&#xe4;ttigheter; kv MR f&#xf6;rsvarar</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida provides core support for implementation of AWID&apos;s strategic     plan 2013-2016. The goal is to strengthen women&apos;s rights (WR) org and to influence donors and other actors to support women&apos;s rights        movements. AWID&apos;s focus areas are; 1)challenging religious            fundamentalisms 2) Ec justice &amp; fin. for WR 3) Women human rights     defenders.</narrative>
  </description>
